tre pour quelque chose.—Puisque Madame ma mere s'amuse a me guetter , je voudrois bien la tromper , je scais que tu est habile — ne pourra tu pas nous menager une petite tete a tete ? ’ I love that girl to madness ; but as to marrying her I am not quite sure I should acquit myself well were I to promise that I would love her for ever . I desire too that interest may have nothing to do with her affection for me . As my mother amuses herself with watching me , I long to deceive her . You are a clever fellow ; can not you contrive for us a private meeting ? “
